tools.description:
Get a five-minute Ed25519 signed presence observation. Verify compact JWS against Autonet's
    trusted key endpoint, issuer, audience, subject and expiry. Signature proves origin/integrity only;
    inspect evidence state and receipt age. Not an identity, reachability or safety certificate.

Register a real worker once. Heartbeat mode needs no endpoint and reports contact only.
    Probe mode requires your own deployed readiness URL. Store the returned owner key securely;
    it is shown once. name, contact, note and version are public. Never invent monitoring activity.
